{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-23-1","title":"Job 23:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Job longs to appear before God, 6 in confidence of his mercy. 8 God, who is invisible, observes our ways. 11 Job's innocency. 13 God's decree is immutable.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-2","title":"Job 23:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>my complaint. 6:2; 10:1; La 3:19,20; Ps 77:2-9 stroke. Heb. hand. heavier. 11:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-3","title":"Job 23:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Oh that. 13:3; 16:21; 40:1-5; Isa 26:8; Jer 14:7 where. Isa 55:6,7; 2Co 5:19,20; Heb 4:6 that I might. 31:35-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-4","title":"Job 23:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>order. 13:18; 37:19; Ps 43:1; Isa 43:26 fill my mouth. Ge 18:25-32; 32:12; Ex 32:12,13; Nu 14:13-19; Jos 7:8,9; Ps 25:11 Da 9:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-5","title":"Job 23:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>know. 10:2; 13:22,23; 42:2-6; 1Co 4:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-6","title":"Job 23:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>plead. 9:19,33,34; 13:21; Isa 27:4,8; Eze 20:33,35 but he would. Ps 138:3; 2Co 12:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-7","title":"Job 23:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>There. Isa 1:18; Jer 3:5; 12:1 so should. 9:15; Ro 3:19-22; 8:1,33,34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-8","title":"Job 23:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>9:11; Ps 10:1; 13:1-3; Isa 45:15; 1Ti 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-9","title":"Job 23:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>he hideth himself. Ps 89:46; Isa 8:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-10","title":"Job 23:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he knoweth. Ge 18:19; 2Ki 20:3; Ps 1:6; 139:1-3; Joh 21:17; 2Ti 2:19 the way that I take. Heb. the way that is with me. he hath. 1:11,12; 2:5,6; De 8:2; Ps 17:3; 66:10; Pr 17:3; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:2,3 Heb 11:17; Jas 1:2-4,12; 1Pe 1:7 I shall. 42:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-11","title":"Job 23:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>My foot. 1Sa 12:2-5; Ps 18:20-24; 44:18; Ac 20:18,19,33,34; 2Co 1:12 1Th 2:10 his way. 17:9; Ps 36:3; 125:5; Zep 1:6; Lu 8:13-15; Ro 2:7; 2Pe 2:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-12","title":"Job 23:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Neither. Joh 6:66-69; 8:31; Ac 14:22; Heb 10:38,39; 1Jo 2:19 I have esteemed. Heb. hid, or, laid up. 22:22; Ps 19:9,10; 119:11,103,127; Jer 15:16; Joh 4:32,34; 1Pe 2:2 necessary food. or, appointed portion. Lu 12:42,46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-13","title":"Job 23:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>who can. 9:12,13; 11:10; 12:14; 34:29; Nu 23:19,20; Ec 1:15; 3:14; Ro 9:19 Jas 1:17 and what. Ps 115:3; 135:6; Pr 19:21; Isa 14:24-27; 46:10; Da 4:35; Eph 1:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-14","title":"Job 23:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>appointed. 7:3; Mic 6:9; 1Th 3:3; 5:9; 1Pe 2:8 many such. Ps 77:19; 97:2; Isa 40:27,28; Ro 11:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-15","title":"Job 23:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>3; 10:15; 31:23; Ps 77:3; 119:120; Hab 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-16","title":"Job 23:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>For God. Ps 22:14; Isa 6:5; 57:16 Almighty. 27:2; Ru 1:20; Ps 88:16; Joe 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-23-17","title":"Job 23:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>cut off. 6:9; 2Ki 22:20; Isa 57:1 the darkness from. 15:22; 18:6,18; 19:8; 22:11</p>"}]}